Description: Rapid querying, colocalization, and plotting of summary stats from the eQTL Catalogue <https://www.ebi.ac.uk/eqtl/>. eQTL Catalogue currently contains >100 datasets from 20 different studies (including GTEx), across many tissues/cell types/conditions.
